<h2>Buffalo claim questions</h2><div class="faq"><details><summary>My roof sagged after a heavy snowfall. Is that covered?<span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Many policies cover collapse or damage caused by the weight of snow and ice, though wording varies. If coverage is accepted but the repair amount is disputed, appraisal can help settle it.</p></div></details><details><summary>Does appraisal work for a two-family home?<span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes. We scope both units and any loss-of-rents element under your policy so the amount reflects the whole building.</p></div></details></div>
